== 7. Ljunggren; 'triangular sum of cubes'
ok    triangular numbers T_n (n < 10^6) whose square is triangular: [0, 1, 6]
      triangular numbers that are a sum of two distinct positive cubes: [28, 91, 351, 2926] (28 = 1^3 + 3^3 = T_7, 91 = 3^3 + 4^3 = T_13)
ok    so 'the only triangular sum of cubes' needs 'of the FIRST n cubes, n > 1'
ok    and 1 = 1^3 = T_1 is a triangular sum of the first n = 1 cubes (README: 'n > 1')

